  "post_title": "Un sábado muy intenso en Chaplin, La Toska y Década de Onda",
  "post_date": "2015-09-21 21:01:08",
  "post_name": "un-sabado-muy-intenso-en-chaplin-la-toska-y-decada-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(113 fotos) Este s&aacute;bado ha sido muy intenso en Onda, con actividades variadas organizadas por Chaplin Caf&eacute; (degustaci&oacute;n de vinos y cava Magnanimus, acompa&ntilde;ados de tapas y helado), La Toska y el pub D&eacute;cada, estos dos &uacute;ltimos con conciertos en directo. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_2634.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">La degustaci&oacute;n de Chaplin Caf&eacute; ha sido organizada por Meridiano Ib&eacute;rico, productos guourmet y de autor, muchos de ellos procedentes de la marca Kil&oacute;metro 0.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_2650.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">En La Toska ha actuado por la tarde el joven grupo de flamenquito-fusi&oacute;n Al l&iacute;mite,</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_2679.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">mientras por la noche los han hecho los ya veteranos del tr&iacute;o Colombo.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_2744.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">En D&eacute;cada, el ambiente ha sido totalmente flamenco y rociero, con la actuaci&oacute;n de Sent&iacute;o.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2607.jpg\" alt=\"img_2607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2609.jpg\" alt=\"img_2609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2611.jpg\" alt=\"img_2611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2613.jpg\" alt=\"img_2613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2614.jpg\" alt=\"img_2614\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2615.jpg\" alt=\"img_2615\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2616.jpg\" alt=\"img_2616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2617.jpg\" alt=\"img_2617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2618.jpg\" alt=\"img_2618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2623.jpg\" alt=\"img_2623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_2625.jpg\" alt=\"img_2625\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte190915chaplinlatoskadecada/img_